        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "５０キロ　さきに　いる　えものを みつけると　さばくを　およぐように いどうして　とびかかり　かみつく。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il peut repérer une proie à une distance de 50 km. Il s’approche alors en « nageant » dans le sable, puis lui saute dessus pour la croquer.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "When it spots prey, even at a distance of over 30 miles, it swims through the desert as if it were water, then jumps out and chomps them.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "５０キロ　先に　いる　獲物を 見つけると　砂漠を　泳ぐように 移動して　飛びかかり　噛みつく。",
