        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Lors des tempêtes de sable provoquées par Libégon, il se terre dans le sol, à l’affût d’une proie.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It conceals itself in sandstorms that Flygon whip up and waits patiently for prey to appear.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "フライゴンの　起こす　砂嵐に 身を　潜めて　獲物が　くるのを じっと　待ちかまえている。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "すなの　ギャングとも　よばれる。 きょうりょくな　アゴで　ぶあつい てっぱんも　たやすく　くいちぎる。",
